WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:27.160
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:27.430 --> 01:34.920
[The Great Long March]

3
01:35.350 --> 01:37.780
[Episode 7]

4
01:38.970 --> 01:40.740
Comrades, fellow villagers.

5
01:39.060 --> 01:42.270
[Liyuanbao, Nanliang, Qingyang, Gansu]

6
01:41.430 --> 01:44.400
Today, our Shaanxi-Gansu Border Region Soviet Government

7
01:43.160 --> 01:45.979
[Xi Zhongxun, Chairman of the Soviet Government of the Shaanxi-Gansu Border Region]

8
01:44.789 --> 01:46.280
is officially established!

9
01:46.090 --> 01:47.330
[Liu Zhidan, Chairman of the Revolutionary Military Commission of the Shaanxi-Gansu Border Region]

10
01:54.360 --> 01:55.420
Its establishment

11
01:55.580 --> 01:57.789
is the result of the joint struggle of the masses

12
01:57.789 --> 01:59.759
in the Shaanxi-Gansu Border Region.

13
01:59.759 --> 02:01.560
It is the fruit of the heroic battles fought by the Red Army

14
02:01.560 --> 02:03.490
under the leadership of the Party.

15
02:03.930 --> 02:06.460
It also marks the beginning of a new situation

16
02:06.460 --> 02:08.380
for our Shaanxi-Gansu Border Region!

17
02:08.380 --> 02:14.220
Good!

18
02:14.890 --> 02:15.570
Just now,

19
02:17.290 --> 02:20.050
I heard the villagers call me the "boy chairman."

20
02:22.730 --> 02:24.120
Actually, I am very happy.

21
02:24.120 --> 02:27.520
It shows that you don't treat me, Xi Zhongxun, as an outsider.

22
02:27.650 --> 02:30.579
You all support me

23
02:30.890 --> 02:32.320
and treat me like family.

24
02:32.440 --> 02:35.620
This is my confidence in being the chairman of the Soviet.

25
02:35.620 --> 02:36.410
From now on,

26
02:36.800 --> 02:38.079
I will continue to unite

27
02:38.079 --> 02:39.030
with everyone.

28
02:39.310 --> 02:41.150
Let's pull together,

29
02:41.630 --> 02:43.750
expand the influence of the border region,

30
02:43.750 --> 02:45.590
strengthen our armed forces,

31
02:45.750 --> 02:47.990
smash the KMT troop's "encirclement and suppression" campaigns

32
02:47.990 --> 02:50.140
and push the Soviet work in our Shaanxi-Gansu border region

33
02:50.140 --> 02:51.820
to a new climax!

34
02:51.840 --> 02:57.280
Good!

35
02:58.090 --> 02:58.900
Good!

36
03:03.240 --> 03:04.030
Good!

37
03:13.400 --> 03:15.170
Good! Very good!

38
03:16.440 --> 03:17.250
Good!

39
03:18.750 --> 03:19.560
Good!

40
03:21.600 --> 03:22.200
Good!

41
03:29.920 --> 03:33.320
At 16:00 on November 7, 1934,

42
03:33.560 --> 03:36.050
Zhu De sent a telegram to Peng Dehuai and others,

43
03:36.050 --> 03:39.620
deciding that the Central Red Army would break through the third blockade

44
03:39.620 --> 03:41.780
between Liangtian, north of Yizhang,

45
03:41.960 --> 03:43.960
and Pingshi, southeast of Yizhang.

46
03:44.450 --> 03:45.530
Following the order,

47
03:45.530 --> 03:48.720
the 3rd Red Army Corps advanced rapidly towards Yizhang.

48
03:48.720 --> 03:51.050
The 5th Red Division occupied Liangtian.

49
03:51.050 --> 03:54.150
The 1st Red Army Corps marched towards Jiufeng Mountain.

50
03:54.150 --> 03:56.079
The 4th Red Regiment occupied Jiufeng Mountain

51
03:56.079 --> 03:58.140
and the Chaling Heights to the south.

52
03:58.360 --> 03:59.750
At dawn on the 11th,

53
04:00.030 --> 04:02.380
the 6th Red Division captured Yizhang City.

54
04:02.380 --> 04:04.730
The third defense line built by the Kuomintang

55
04:04.730 --> 04:06.640
was torn open.

56
04:06.410 --> 04:09.580
[Nanchang Headquarters, Jiangxi]

57
04:10.470 --> 04:12.920
[Chiang Kai-shek, Chairman of the Military Affairs Commission of the National Government]

58
04:13.030 --> 04:15.370
[He Guoguang, Director of the 1st Department, Nanchang Headquarters]

59
04:13.530 --> 04:14.460
Generalissimo.

60
04:15.250 --> 04:16.579
The situation is clear.

61
04:17.200 --> 04:20.120
The Communist army's action is not a tactical adjustment,

62
04:20.120 --> 04:22.440
but a large-scale strategic transfer.

63
04:28.060 --> 04:29.470
[Yan Daogang, Director of the Attendants' Office of the Generalissimo of the Military Affairs Commission]

64
04:32.930 --> 04:35.810
Gentlemen, I think

65
04:36.320 --> 04:39.810
the Communist army's transfer this time is...

66
04:44.210 --> 04:46.680
Why are you all so serious?

67
04:52.870 --> 04:55.530
I think the Communist army's transfer this time

68
04:56.130 --> 04:58.200
is just fleeing in panic.

69
04:58.550 --> 05:00.560
As for their so-called strategic intention,

70
05:00.560 --> 05:04.240
do you think the Communist army's action this time

71
05:04.260 --> 05:06.500
has anything to do with strategy?

72
05:07.550 --> 05:08.810
I also find it strange.

73
05:09.120 --> 05:10.600
Didn't they say before

74
05:10.960 --> 05:12.130
that they would counterattack in six routes

75
05:12.130 --> 05:13.570
and keep the enemy out of the territory?

76
05:13.570 --> 05:15.100
Why did they suddenly flee?

77
05:15.720 --> 05:16.670
In the fifth encirclement and suppression campaign,

78
05:16.670 --> 05:17.780
we advanced steadily.

79
05:17.780 --> 05:20.280
[Yang Yongtai, Secretary of Nanchang Headquarters]

80
05:17.920 --> 05:18.870
Their base area

81
05:18.960 --> 05:20.630
was compressed smaller and smaller.

82
05:20.630 --> 05:21.740
If they don't run now,

83
05:21.740 --> 05:23.200
what are they waiting for?

84
05:23.360 --> 05:24.720
For these mere tens of thousands of Communist soldiers,

85
05:24.720 --> 05:27.000
I'm afraid they can't even gather enough uniforms and guns.

86
05:27.000 --> 05:28.600
Then what are they fleeing for?

87
05:28.600 --> 05:29.730
To beg along the way?

88
05:31.540 --> 05:33.100
All right, gentlemen.

89
05:33.430 --> 05:34.960
Let's get back to business.

90
05:35.040 --> 05:35.820
Zurong (Yan Gangdao),

91
05:35.820 --> 05:38.280
tell everyone about our army's deployment.

92
05:39.070 --> 05:39.750
Yes!

93
05:40.070 --> 05:41.930
The Generalissimo's deployment is as follows.

94
05:41.930 --> 05:42.920
First,

95
05:42.940 --> 05:46.040
He Jian is appointed as the Commander-in-Chief of the Pursuit Army,

96
05:46.040 --> 05:49.210
commanding the Western Route Army that originally encircled the Central Soviet Area,

97
05:49.210 --> 05:50.970
and the two units of Xue Yue

98
05:51.000 --> 05:53.020
and Zhou Hunyuan in the North Route Army, totaling 16 Divisions

99
05:53.020 --> 05:54.020
and 77 Regiments,

100
05:54.070 --> 05:56.060
to specialize in pursuing the main force of the Red Army.

101
05:56.060 --> 05:56.820
Second,

102
05:57.010 --> 06:00.230
Chen Jitang's South Route Army will push its headquarters to Shaoguan.

103
06:00.230 --> 06:01.770
Except for leaving a part of the army

104
06:01.770 --> 06:04.430
to continue the suppression in Jiangxi and Fujian,

105
06:04.430 --> 06:06.690
all other units will build defense lines

106
06:06.720 --> 06:07.600
to intercept.

107
06:08.270 --> 06:08.950
Third,

108
06:08.950 --> 06:10.270
Li Zongren of the Guangxi Army

109
06:10.270 --> 06:12.920
and Bai Chongxi will set their headquarters in Guilin.

110
06:12.920 --> 06:15.120
All troops will concentrate in northern Guangxi,

111
06:15.120 --> 06:18.190
ready to participate in the encirclement and interception operations at any time.

112
06:18.190 --> 06:19.120
Fourth,

113
06:19.140 --> 06:20.560
Wang Jialie of the Guizhou Army

114
06:20.560 --> 06:23.890
will send strong troops to intercept at the Guizhou border,

115
06:24.190 --> 06:26.330
annihilating the Red Army east of the Xiangjiang

116
06:26.330 --> 06:27.940
and Lijiang rivers.

117
06:27.970 --> 06:30.970
The above deployment can be summarized in four words:

118
06:31.010 --> 06:33.500
encircle, pursue, block, and intercept.

119
06:36.100 --> 06:37.630
Did everyone hear clearly?

120
06:38.000 --> 06:38.800
Clear!

121
06:38.820 --> 06:39.650
Good.

122
06:40.320 --> 06:41.850
In the previous encirclement and suppression campaigns,

123
06:41.850 --> 06:43.680
because of the cunning of the Communist army,

124
06:43.680 --> 06:45.270
we suffered some losses.

125
06:45.560 --> 06:46.830
It was probably because

126
06:46.830 --> 06:49.830
their so-called base area still luckily existed.

127
06:50.000 --> 06:51.310
But this time,

128
06:51.330 --> 06:53.010
I am confident

129
06:53.390 --> 06:55.050
in our strategic deployment.

130
06:55.070 --> 06:57.510
I am full of confidence in you all.

131
06:58.190 --> 07:01.070
Since the Communist army has come out in full force this time,

132
07:01.070 --> 07:03.560
we must eradicate them completely!

133
07:03.870 --> 07:05.190
Yes!

134
07:05.310 --> 07:10.450
[Yizhang County, Hunan]

135
07:08.270 --> 07:09.270
What's your name?

136
07:09.600 --> 07:10.730
My name is Cui Fulai.

137
07:11.630 --> 07:13.390
You are from Niutian, Jiangxi?

138
07:13.510 --> 07:14.720
Yes, from Niutian.

139
07:14.830 --> 07:16.230
You worked for 13 days, right?

140
07:16.230 --> 07:16.600
Yes.

141
07:16.920 --> 07:17.480
13 yuan.

142
07:17.370 --> 07:18.560
[Liu Ying, Director of the Political Department of the 3rd Echelon, 2nd Column of the Military Commission]

143
07:18.160 --> 07:20.800
You too, put your fingerprint here.

144
07:21.750 --> 07:22.390
Okay.

145
07:24.800 --> 07:28.270
Fellow villagers, comrades!

146
07:28.800 --> 07:30.870
Welcome to our performance!

147
07:31.600 --> 07:33.720
Come watch our performance!

148
07:34.760 --> 07:35.840
Comrades.

149
07:36.230 --> 07:38.280
We have a performance later.

150
07:39.040 --> 07:41.640
We'll perform a living newspaper play for you!

151
07:41.730 --> 07:42.800
Comrades!

152
07:43.130 --> 07:45.990
Today we are performing the living newspaper play,

153
07:46.480 --> 07:48.510
"Who Are We Fighting For"!

154
07:49.940 --> 07:52.600
Fellow villagers, come watch the performance!

155
07:53.310 --> 07:55.970
Come watch our performance, fellow villagers!

156
07:56.480 --> 07:59.070
Fellow villagers, come on over!

157
07:59.310 --> 08:00.600
Comrades!

158
08:01.600 --> 08:02.560
Come watch our performance!

159
08:02.560 --> 08:04.870
Fellow villagers, the play is starting!

160
08:07.120 --> 08:08.680
Villager, it's your turn.

161
08:08.680 --> 08:10.390
Comrade Red Army, my name is Li Decai.

162
08:10.390 --> 08:11.270
Li Decai.

163
08:11.870 --> 08:13.270
Twenty-three years old.

164
08:22.360 --> 08:26.720
Holding a tobacco pipe in the left hand,

165
08:27.680 --> 08:31.850
holding an abacus in the right hand.

166
08:33.020 --> 08:34.730
Scoundrel Boss Wang,

167
08:35.120 --> 08:36.919
hurry up and bring out the money.

168
08:37.669 --> 08:39.750
If you don't bring out the money,

169
08:39.960 --> 08:42.510
I will arrest you.

170
08:42.510 --> 08:44.820
[Qian Zhuangfei, Deputy Director of the Second Bureau, Central Revolutionary Military Commission]

171
08:42.720 --> 08:44.790
I willl arrest you!

172
08:53.910 --> 08:56.790
You are a big landlord...

173
08:56.840 --> 08:58.240
In January 1928,

174
08:58.510 --> 09:00.840
Chen Yi and I launched the Year-End Uprising

175
09:00.840 --> 09:02.500
and occupied Yizhang County.

176
09:02.550 --> 09:03.880
It was on this very stage

177
09:03.950 --> 09:06.280
that we sang operas for two days straight.

178
09:06.330 --> 09:08.930
That was the prelude to the Xiangnan Uprising.

179
09:09.890 --> 09:10.760
It's a pity.

180
09:12.240 --> 09:13.440
We were outnumbered.

181
09:13.880 --> 09:15.720
We held out for less than 3 months

182
09:16.520 --> 09:18.780
before we had to go up Jinggang Mountain.

183
09:20.050 --> 09:21.770
A blessing in disguise.

184
09:22.420 --> 09:24.120
If you hadn't gone up Jinggang Mountain

185
09:24.120 --> 09:25.840
and joined forces with Comrade Zedong,

186
09:25.840 --> 09:28.290
how could there be the Fourth Red Army?

187
09:28.560 --> 09:30.560
[Zhu De, Chairman of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission and Commander-in-Chief of the Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army]

188
09:29.090 --> 09:30.130
Enlai.

189
09:30.850 --> 09:32.650
I sincerely hope that this time,

190
09:33.270 --> 09:35.390
it will also be a blessing in disguise for us.

191
09:35.390 --> 09:37.250
Farming the fields day and night,

192
09:37.600 --> 09:40.840
oppressed by landlords to this day...

193
09:41.280 --> 09:44.250
To this day.

194
09:45.150 --> 09:46.880
These days I increasingly feel

195
09:47.030 --> 09:48.780
that Mao's suggestion back then was right.

196
09:48.690 --> 09:51.590
[Zhou Enlai, CCP Politburo Standing Committee Member; Vice Chair of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission; General Political Commissar of the Red Army]

197
09:50.180 --> 09:51.660
As we keep heading west,

198
09:51.840 --> 09:54.440
I'm afraid there will be more and more enemies.

199
09:54.720 --> 09:56.450
He Jian is not like Chen Jitang.

200
09:57.610 --> 09:59.740
He is dead set against the Communists.

201
09:59.840 --> 10:02.120
Li De and Bo Gu are single-mindedly pushing west.

202
10:02.120 --> 10:04.020
They simply won't listen to different opinions,

203
10:04.020 --> 10:06.150
let alone Comrade Zedong's opinions.

204
10:06.780 --> 10:10.180
I feel that their differences in understanding

205
10:10.200 --> 10:11.410
with Comrade Zedong

206
10:11.670 --> 10:13.730
probably still stem from prejudice.

207
10:15.990 --> 10:17.250
Enlai, how about this?

208
10:17.320 --> 10:19.390
Let's go find Bo Gu and try to persuade him.

209
10:19.390 --> 10:19.920
Alright.

210
10:20.480 --> 10:23.120
I was captured by them.

211
10:23.320 --> 10:24.440
Get up quickly, villager.

212
10:24.440 --> 10:26.500
The Red Army doesn't kill prisoners.

213
10:26.870 --> 10:28.800
As long as you lay down your weapons,

214
10:28.800 --> 10:31.560
we can even give you travel money to go home.

215
10:31.910 --> 10:32.600
Really?

216
10:32.750 --> 10:33.880
Of course it's true.

217
10:34.130 --> 10:36.080
The Red Army doesn't conscript by force.

218
10:36.080 --> 10:37.980
Joining the army is entirely voluntary.

219
10:37.980 --> 10:39.640
Then why did you join the army?

220
10:40.240 --> 10:41.570
To fight the White bandits.

221
10:41.570 --> 10:42.810
To save the country.

222
10:42.940 --> 10:45.150
For millions of poor people

223
10:45.420 --> 10:47.680
to have houses to live in, fields to farm,

224
10:47.680 --> 10:50.640
and enough food and clothing.

225
10:50.730 --> 10:52.330
Good, good, good.

226
10:53.020 --> 10:54.950
Red Army comrade, I'm not leaving.

227
10:54.990 --> 10:56.920
I want to stay and join the Red Army.

228
10:57.150 --> 10:59.440
To catch those man-eating landlords,

229
10:59.790 --> 11:02.120
drive away those harmful White bandits,

230
11:02.600 --> 11:05.480
and live like a human being!

231
11:05.720 --> 11:06.240
Good!

232
11:06.720 --> 11:07.960
Good, good, good.

233
11:07.960 --> 11:09.420
The Red Army welcomes you!

234
11:10.510 --> 11:11.790
Let's go together

235
11:11.910 --> 11:13.440
to liberate your hometown.

236
11:13.720 --> 11:16.390
Fight the local tyrants and distribute the land!

237
11:16.390 --> 11:18.870
Fight the local tyrants and distribute the land!

238
11:18.870 --> 11:21.600
Fight the local tyrants and distribute the land!

239
11:21.670 --> 11:23.840
Fight the local tyrants and distribute the land!

240
11:23.840 --> 11:27.240
Fight the local tyrants and distribute the land!

241
11:27.910 --> 11:35.440
Fight the local tyrants and distribute the land!

242
11:35.880 --> 11:38.270
After the strategic transfer of the main force of the Central Red Army,

243
11:38.270 --> 11:40.080
the KMT troops launched a full-scale attack

244
11:40.080 --> 11:41.790
on the Central Soviet Area.

245
11:42.550 --> 11:44.840
On November 10, 1934,

246
11:45.030 --> 11:47.750
the KMT troops captured Ruijin.

247
11:48.410 --> 11:49.560
Long time no see, Linsheng (Li Mo'an).

248
11:49.560 --> 11:52.160
[Li Mo'an, Commander of the Kuomintang East Route Army’s 10th Division]

249
11:49.960 --> 11:50.720
Yes.

250
11:51.670 --> 11:52.550
You should know

251
11:52.840 --> 11:54.480
that the closest to Ruijin originally

252
11:54.480 --> 11:56.340
was Li Yannian's Ninth Division.

253
11:56.790 --> 11:59.630
But the Generalissimo specially sent a telegram to stop him,

254
11:59.630 --> 12:02.720
and instead ordered you to lead your troops to capture Ruijin.

255
12:02.720 --> 12:05.520
You understand the intention behind this, right?

256
12:06.560 --> 12:10.230
I am dull. Please enlighten me, Commander-in-Chief.

257
12:12.180 --> 12:15.540
It's because you used to be a Communist Party member.

258
12:20.960 --> 12:21.670
Linsheng,

259
12:22.550 --> 12:24.260
you were the first among the Whampoa students

260
12:24.260 --> 12:27.320
to announce your withdrawal from the Communist Party.

261
12:27.720 --> 12:29.920
Sticking to the right path and being loyal to the Party and the country.

262
12:29.920 --> 12:31.980
That's why you have such a grand prospect today.

263
12:31.980 --> 12:32.660
Yes.

264
12:33.360 --> 12:36.620
I heard from those who surrendered from the Communist army

265
12:36.950 --> 12:39.930
that Chen Geng, who entered Whampoa with you back then,

266
12:39.930 --> 12:41.570
fled back from Nanjing,

267
12:41.940 --> 12:45.600
and the Communist army didn't even restore his Party membership.

268
12:46.150 --> 12:49.010
Life is a long journey. Choices are very important.

269
12:49.200 --> 12:49.820
Yes.

270
12:50.870 --> 12:52.690
The Principal doesn't hold past grudges,

271
12:52.690 --> 12:54.780
and I am deeply grateful.

272
12:55.920 --> 12:59.660
[Provisional Central Government of the Chinese Soviet Republic]

273
12:56.590 --> 12:57.670
Commander-in-Chief.

274
12:57.670 --> 12:58.200
Here

275
12:58.200 --> 13:01.120
is the auditorium of the Communist Party's Provisional Central Government.

276
13:01.120 --> 13:02.060
Earlier this year,

277
13:02.060 --> 13:03.790
they held here

278
13:03.940 --> 13:06.070
the Second National Soviet Congress.

279
13:06.240 --> 13:07.950
There are two floors in total,

280
13:08.600 --> 13:11.000
which can accommodate about two thousand people.

281
13:11.000 --> 13:13.800
The facilities inside remain basically the same.

282
13:14.000 --> 13:14.800
And over here,

283
13:15.100 --> 13:16.700
there is an air-raid shelter

284
13:16.880 --> 13:18.790
so that they can transfer in time

285
13:19.010 --> 13:21.410
to avoid the air raids of our national army.

286
13:21.640 --> 13:23.040
We have checked them all.

287
13:23.480 --> 13:24.910
Almost next to every important facility

288
13:24.910 --> 13:26.790
of the Communist army,

289
13:27.120 --> 13:29.380
there is such an air-raid shelter built.

290
13:33.240 --> 13:35.590
Gentlemen, after every battle,

291
13:36.120 --> 13:38.150
we must summarize our combat experience.

292
13:38.150 --> 13:40.480
Why is the Communist army never wiped out?

293
13:41.120 --> 13:43.400
Being good at digging holes

294
13:43.600 --> 13:45.240
is also one of their methods.

295
13:47.090 --> 13:47.820
Company Commander Liu!

296
13:47.820 --> 13:48.490
Yes, sir!

297
13:49.200 --> 13:51.030
Including this auditorium,

298
13:51.360 --> 13:53.550
all important buildings, air-raid shelters,

299
13:53.550 --> 13:56.000
and the Communist army's fortifications and bunkers along the way

300
13:56.000 --> 13:57.670
must be surveyed in detail.

301
13:57.920 --> 13:58.820
Analyze the data,

302
13:58.820 --> 14:00.260
and summarize their structural features

303
14:00.260 --> 14:01.380
so that our army

304
14:01.410 --> 14:02.710
can carry out targeted encirclement and suppression in the future.

305
14:02.710 --> 14:03.520
Yes, sir!

306
14:06.440 --> 14:07.410
Take a picture.

307
14:10.630 --> 14:12.840
Three, two, one.

308
14:14.930 --> 14:17.490
Why are you taking a picture of me? Take a picture of this.

309
14:17.490 --> 14:18.040
Yes, sir.

310
