621
29:45.500 --> 29:47.890
When he's scared, he can't sleep.

622
29:48.430 --> 29:50.880
When he can't sleep, he easily wets the bed.

623
29:51.200 --> 29:52.310
And it can't be dried in the sun.

624
29:52.310 --> 29:53.440
After ten days or so,

625
29:53.490 --> 29:54.820
his crotch is rotten.

626
29:56.400 --> 29:57.260
When we get back to Huashanzhai,

627
29:57.260 --> 29:58.630
we have to treat him properly.

628
29:58.510 --> 30:03.640
[Wu Huanxian, Political Commissar of the 25th Red Army]

629
29:59.100 --> 30:00.860
Such a small child

630
30:02.350 --> 30:04.350
shouldn't be on the battlefield.

631
30:09.060 --> 30:10.640
You've been carrying him for days, right?

632
30:10.640 --> 30:11.640
Let me do it today.

633
30:12.070 --> 30:12.670
It's fine.

634
30:12.830 --> 30:14.710
Just let me bear the smell alone.

635
30:15.610 --> 30:16.610
You carry the map.

636
30:16.640 --> 30:17.330
Okay.

637
30:19.700 --> 30:21.150
Gao Zhugen, come here!

638
30:21.830 --> 30:22.580
Follow me.

639
30:24.960 --> 30:25.930
Can you walk faster?

640
30:25.930 --> 30:27.100
Ouch.

641
30:35.350 --> 30:36.310
Commander, Political Commissar.

642
30:36.310 --> 30:38.060
[Han Xianchu, Commander of the Company under the 2nd Battalion, 225th Regiment, 25th Red Army]

643
30:37.470 --> 30:39.710
Caught red-handed.

644
30:40.390 --> 30:41.650
Look at what he's done.

645
30:43.250 --> 30:44.380
Admit your mistake.

646
30:52.360 --> 30:55.040
Gao Zhugen, where did these potatoes come from?

647
30:59.480 --> 31:01.410
I'm asking you. Where did the potatoes come from?

648
31:01.410 --> 31:02.650
I'm asking you.

649
31:04.060 --> 31:04.620
Wake up.

650
31:05.750 --> 31:06.480
Come here.

651
31:06.720 --> 31:09.250
He must have dug them from a villager's field.

652
31:11.570 --> 31:12.240
Gao Zhugen.

653
31:12.910 --> 31:13.830
Is that true?

654
31:28.840 --> 31:29.600
Gao Zhugen.

655
31:30.070 --> 31:32.610
I didn't criticize you for wetting your pants every day, did I?

656
31:32.610 --> 31:34.590
I didn't criticize you when you peed on me.

657
31:34.590 --> 31:35.880
You peed on the map.

658
31:36.790 --> 31:38.030
And I didn't criticize you either.

659
31:38.030 --> 31:39.830
I just dried the map out for you,

660
31:39.860 --> 31:42.390
and now you've gone and made another mistake.

661
31:42.970 --> 31:44.450
Three Rules of Discipline and Eight Points for Attention.

662
31:44.450 --> 31:45.580
You forgot them all.

663
31:47.360 --> 31:48.880
Come, teach him a lesson!

664
31:51.240 --> 31:55.720
One, obey orders in all your actions.

665
31:56.110 --> 32:00.750
Two, do not take a single needle or piece of thread from the masses.

666
32:01.310 --> 32:05.640
Three, turn in everything captured.

667
32:06.020 --> 32:07.740
Eight Points for Attention.

668
32:08.440 --> 32:11.680
One, speak politely.

669
32:12.120 --> 32:14.470
Two, pay fairly for what you buy.

670
32:14.490 --> 32:15.730
Alright.

671
32:16.150 --> 32:17.360
Stop making a fuss.

672
32:22.960 --> 32:25.160
What, still won't admit your mistake?

673
32:28.270 --> 32:29.670
Fine, then you can leave.

674
32:29.790 --> 32:30.830
In our Red Army,

675
32:30.850 --> 32:32.440
we don't have soldiers like you.

676
32:32.440 --> 32:33.900
Come, give me back the hat.

677
32:35.990 --> 32:38.250
Are you worthy of the red star on this hat?

678
32:38.460 --> 32:39.400
Take off your clothes too.

679
32:39.400 --> 32:40.330
And these pants!

680
32:40.540 --> 32:43.200
Even if they're wet, they belong to the Red Army!

681
32:43.900 --> 32:45.720
I used to call you Comrade Gao Zhugen.

682
32:45.720 --> 32:47.400
But you're not a comrade anymore.

683
32:47.400 --> 32:48.770
Go back to Macheng bare-bottomed.

684
32:48.770 --> 32:51.370
And see if the folks there still recognize you!

685
32:51.720 --> 32:52.530
Commander.

686
32:52.900 --> 32:55.710
I saw you carrying me all day.

687
32:55.970 --> 32:57.810
And I thought you must be hungry.

688
32:58.060 --> 33:01.190
So I wanted to pick some potatoes for you.

689
33:14.140 --> 33:16.540
But even so, you can't violate discipline.

690
33:17.540 --> 33:18.870
I know you meant well.

691
33:19.600 --> 33:21.030
You were worried I'd go hungry.

692
33:21.030 --> 33:22.460
But if you take the villagers' things,

693
33:22.460 --> 33:23.980
won't they go hungry?

694
33:24.010 --> 33:25.340
Isn't it the same logic?

695
33:25.380 --> 33:27.840
You must remember you are a Red Army soldier.

696
33:27.850 --> 33:28.680
Right?

697
33:30.240 --> 33:30.750
Come.

698
33:31.740 --> 33:34.370
Put them back where you got them.

699
33:34.900 --> 33:36.760
Admitting your mistake makes you a good comrade.

700
33:36.760 --> 33:38.440
Come, put your hat on.

701
33:40.750 --> 33:41.160
Go.

702
33:41.550 --> 33:42.610
They're already dug up.

703
33:42.610 --> 33:43.740
Can they be put back?

704
33:44.230 --> 33:45.960
Let's follow the army's rules.

705
33:47.190 --> 33:49.470
Comrade Gao Zhugen, listen carefully.

706
33:51.350 --> 33:53.200
Today you dug up...

707
33:54.190 --> 33:54.840
How many?

708
33:55.310 --> 33:55.910
Let's see.

709
33:56.350 --> 33:56.950
Let's see.

710
33:57.850 --> 33:59.270
Five, ten.

711
34:00.870 --> 34:02.160
Fifteen, eighteen.

712
34:03.490 --> 34:06.250
Today you dug up eighteen potatoes.

713
34:06.910 --> 34:08.510
Pay for them at market price.

714
34:22.320 --> 34:22.920
Xu.

715
34:24.690 --> 34:25.489
Let's chip in.

716
34:33.360 --> 34:34.469
Report!

717
34:37.590 --> 34:39.000
Commander, Political Commissar.

718
34:39.000 --> 34:40.199
The enemy's pursuing troops are here again.

719
34:40.199 --> 34:40.800
How many?

720
34:41.210 --> 34:41.850
Two regiments.

721
34:41.850 --> 34:43.330
They are less than 15 li away from us.

722
34:43.330 --> 34:45.330
They won't even let us catch our breath.

723
34:45.330 --> 34:46.600
These bastards.

724
34:47.290 --> 34:49.030
They know we are going back home,

725
34:49.030 --> 34:50.840
and they are afraid we might slack off.

726
34:50.840 --> 34:51.770
Pass on my order.

727
34:51.880 --> 34:54.110
The 1st Battalion will be on guard and establish a defense line on the spot.

728
34:54.110 --> 34:55.590
Other regiments will assemble immediately.

729
34:55.590 --> 34:56.280
Get ready to move out.

730
34:56.280 --> 34:56.960
Yes!

731
34:57.510 --> 34:58.590
The enemy is coming!

732
34:58.590 --> 34:59.110
Wake up. Wake up!

733
34:59.110 --> 35:00.440
Wake up. Hurry, wake up!

734
35:00.510 --> 35:01.640
The enemy is coming!

735
35:02.000 --> 35:03.000
Wake up. Wake up!

736
35:03.190 --> 35:03.780
The enemy is coming!

737
35:03.780 --> 35:05.000
Commander, Political Commissar,

738
35:05.000 --> 35:06.080
you lead the main force to transfer first.

739
35:06.080 --> 35:07.160
I'll take him to return the money,

740
35:07.160 --> 35:08.380
and catch up with you when it's done.

741
35:08.380 --> 35:10.150
Okay, be careful.

742
35:14.260 --> 35:14.890
Let's go.

743
35:21.710 --> 35:22.240
Hurry up.

744
35:23.550 --> 35:25.760
Come on, get up, Comrade Zhugen.

745
35:27.290 --> 35:28.690
You can't walk fast.

746
35:29.500 --> 35:30.530
Where are we going?

747
35:30.530 --> 35:33.590
Just down the hillside ahead, next to the crooked tree.

748
35:34.000 --> 35:34.530
Let's go.

749
35:36.190 --> 35:37.510
Why is my back so warm?

750
35:37.950 --> 35:39.680
Did you pee again?

751
35:42.440 --> 35:48.530
[Huashanzhai, Guangshan County, Henan]

752
35:47.210 --> 35:48.410
Comrade Cheng Zihua.

753
35:51.280 --> 35:53.340
Comrade Zihua, let me introduce you.

754
35:53.480 --> 35:54.170
These two

755
35:53.780 --> 35:55.630
[Zheng Weisan, Secretary-General of Hubei-Henan-Anhui Provincial Commission]

756
35:54.250 --> 35:57.310
are Comrade Xu Haidong, Commander of the 25th Red Army,

757
35:57.850 --> 35:59.980
and Political Commissar Wu Huanxian.

758
36:00.810 --> 36:02.280
[Cheng Zihua, Special Commission of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission]

759
36:04.400 --> 36:05.550
Comrade Cheng Zihua,

760
36:05.550 --> 36:06.800
we finally meet.

761
36:07.030 --> 36:09.090
Comrade Haidong, Comrade Huanxian,

762
36:09.150 --> 36:10.970
I've been waiting for you here for over two months.

763
36:10.970 --> 36:11.740
So have we.

764
36:11.870 --> 36:14.110
We've been looking forward to getting instructions from the Central Committee.

765
36:14.110 --> 36:14.930
Come, sit down and talk.

766
36:14.930 --> 36:15.930
Come, come, come.

767
36:17.310 --> 36:18.120
I missed you guys!

768
36:18.120 --> 36:19.840
You must be thirsty. Come, drink some water.

769
36:19.840 --> 36:20.320
Okay.

770
36:20.960 --> 36:21.850
Thank you.

771
36:22.230 --> 36:22.890
Let me do it.

772
36:25.710 --> 36:28.420
The Central Committee has always been concerned about the Hubei-Henan-Anhui Soviet Area.

773
36:28.420 --> 36:30.670
Knowing that this place has been repeatedly encircled and suppressed by the enemy,

774
36:30.670 --> 36:31.480
the Central Committee decided

775
36:31.480 --> 36:32.450
to let the Hubei-Henan-Anhui Provincial Committee

776
36:32.450 --> 36:35.070
and the 25th Red Army withdraw from the Soviet Area

777
36:35.070 --> 36:36.670
to establish a new base area.

778
36:37.900 --> 36:39.980
But because we lost contact with you,

779
36:40.110 --> 36:41.550
the order couldn't be issued.

780
36:41.550 --> 36:43.420
So Vice Chairman Zhou sent me here

781
36:43.440 --> 36:45.360
to convey the Central Committee's instructions.

782
36:45.360 --> 36:46.500
He specifically emphasized

783
36:46.500 --> 36:48.800
that the Central Committee is not clear about the situation here,

784
36:48.800 --> 36:50.630
so you should make your own decisions

785
36:50.630 --> 36:52.120
based on the actual situation.

786
36:52.120 --> 36:53.920
I have already conveyed the specific instructions

787
36:53.920 --> 36:54.980
to Comrade Weisan.

788
36:55.480 --> 36:57.030
How did your meeting go?

789
36:57.400 --> 36:58.330
We have decided,

790
36:58.670 --> 37:00.550
according to the instructions of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission,

791
37:00.550 --> 37:02.030
in the name of the Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army's

792
37:02.030 --> 37:04.030
Second Advance Detachment for Resisting Japanese Aggression and Marching North,

793
37:04.030 --> 37:06.190
to carry out a strategic transfer to the west of the Beiping-Hankou Railway.

794
37:06.190 --> 37:06.990
That's great.

795
37:07.800 --> 37:09.000
Also, before I came,

796
37:09.190 --> 37:10.400
Vice Chairman Zhou instructed me

797
37:10.400 --> 37:12.530
to act together with the 25th Red Army.

798
37:12.880 --> 37:15.340
Now, Comrade Haidong and Comrade Huanxian,

799
37:15.510 --> 37:17.000
please arrange my work.

800
37:17.480 --> 37:18.340
Comrade Zihua,

801
37:18.430 --> 37:19.380
we are here to convey

802
37:19.380 --> 37:21.080
the Hubei-Henan-Anhui Provincial Party Committee's

803
37:21.080 --> 37:22.880
arrangement for your position.

804
37:23.710 --> 37:25.380
After discussion and research, the meeting

805
37:25.380 --> 37:27.370
has readjusted the personnel of the command structure

806
37:27.370 --> 37:28.620
of the Red 25th Army.

807
37:29.010 --> 37:30.200
I will still serve as

808
37:30.220 --> 37:31.950
the Political Commissar of the Red 25th Army.

809
37:31.950 --> 37:34.040
Comrade Haidong will serve as the Deputy Commander.

810
37:34.040 --> 37:38.240
Comrade Dai Jiying will serve as the Director of the Political Department.

811
37:39.280 --> 37:40.080
What about me?

812
37:40.480 --> 37:41.590
The meeting decided

813
37:41.590 --> 37:44.230
to co-opt you into the Hubei-Henan-Anhui Provincial Party Committee

814
37:44.230 --> 37:45.810
and appoint you as

815
37:45.840 --> 37:48.070
the Commander of the 25th Red Army.

816
37:51.510 --> 37:52.310
That won't do.

817
37:53.290 --> 37:54.600
How can that be?

818
37:55.030 --> 37:56.510
I told Comrade Weisan that

819
37:56.960 --> 37:58.920
Vice Chairman Zhou instructed me to serve as

820
37:58.920 --> 38:01.050
the Chief of Staff of the 25th Red Army.

821
38:01.200 --> 38:01.970
How can I take

822
38:02.000 --> 38:04.400
Comrade Haidong's position as Commander?

823
38:04.590 --> 38:06.550
To tell you the truth, Comrade Zihua,

824
38:06.550 --> 38:08.270
the one who strongly recommended you to be the Commander

825
38:08.270 --> 38:09.710
is our Comrade Haidong.

826
38:11.110 --> 38:12.110
Comrade Haidong.

827
38:12.380 --> 38:13.780
What exactly is going on?

828
38:17.370 --> 38:18.230
Comrade Zihua.

829
38:18.280 --> 38:20.030
We have considered this carefully.

830
38:20.030 --> 38:20.760
First of all,

831
38:21.170 --> 38:23.210
you are a top student from the Whampoa Military Academy.

832
38:23.210 --> 38:25.320
As for me, I graduated from Qingshan University.

833
38:25.320 --> 38:27.650
In theory, I'm definitely not as good as you.

834
38:27.650 --> 38:28.910
Qingshan University?

835
38:29.200 --> 38:31.590
I came out of the mountain valleys.

836
38:34.020 --> 38:34.580
Second,

837
38:34.650 --> 38:37.070
you participated in the Guangzhou Uprising.

838
38:37.070 --> 38:39.360
You also served as a Division Commander in the Central Soviet Area.

839
38:39.360 --> 38:41.110
Your combat experience is richer than mine.

840
38:41.110 --> 38:42.390
With you as the Commander,

841
38:42.390 --> 38:44.600
you can better direct the troops in battle.

842
38:44.600 --> 38:45.720
As the Deputy Commander,

843
38:45.720 --> 38:47.120
I can learn a lot from you.

844
38:47.280 --> 38:49.140
Comrade Haidong, I still feel...

845
38:50.070 --> 38:50.930
Comrade Zihua.

846
38:51.400 --> 38:53.460
The 25th Red Army is the Party's army.

847
38:53.590 --> 38:55.360
No matter who serves as the Commander,

848
38:55.360 --> 38:57.510
it's all to better

849
38:57.550 --> 38:59.320
let these troops survive

850
38:59.400 --> 39:00.280
and develop.

851
39:00.550 --> 39:02.230
All right, don't decline.

852
39:07.370 --> 39:08.080
Okay.

853
39:10.590 --> 39:13.440
On November 16, 1934,

854
39:13.530 --> 39:16.560
the 25th Red Army held high the banner of the Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army's

855
39:16.560 --> 39:19.740
Second Advance Detachment for Resisting Japanese Aggression and Marching North

856
39:19.740 --> 39:22.820
and bid farewell to the Dabie Mountains where they had fought for years.

857
39:22.820 --> 39:25.890
They set out from Hejiachong, Luoshan County, Henan Province,

858
39:25.890 --> 39:29.410
and embarked on a strategic transfer to the west.

859
39:30.340 --> 39:31.220
Ten days later,

860
39:31.700 --> 39:34.200
the troops, at Dushu Town, Fangcheng County, Henan Province,

861
39:34.200 --> 39:37.060
were ambushed by Kuomintang infantry and cavalry.

862
39:37.820 --> 39:39.550
The commanders and fighters of the 25th Red Army

863
39:39.550 --> 39:41.690
engaged in hand-to-hand combat with the enemy.

864
39:41.690 --> 39:45.000
They fought a bloody path out of the heavy encirclement

865
39:45.710 --> 39:48.670
and entered the Funiu Mountains that night.

866
39:49.330 --> 39:50.930
On the 22nd of the same month,

867
39:51.050 --> 39:53.620
the Central Red Army captured Dao County

868
39:53.860 --> 39:55.240
and rested there.

869
40:05.340 --> 40:08.140
[Dao County, Yongzhou, Hunan]

870
40:05.880 --> 40:07.610
The Kuomintang's reconnaissance plane is here again.

871
40:07.610 --> 40:09.560
This damn enemy plane is flying so low,

872
40:09.560 --> 40:10.820
sticking to us all the time,

873
40:10.820 --> 40:11.740
like mud.

874
40:12.100 --> 40:14.160
It's just bullying us because we don't have anti-aircraft weapons!

875
40:14.160 --> 40:16.120
Yes, we need anti-aircraft weapons!

876
40:16.120 --> 40:19.080
Yes, you are right!

877
40:19.510 --> 40:20.970
We have nothing right now.

878
40:21.120 --> 40:23.290
But once our forces grow stronger,

879
40:23.400 --> 40:25.260
we will have anti-aircraft guns.

880
40:25.400 --> 40:26.460
We will have tanks.

881
40:26.980 --> 40:28.980
We will have our own planes.

882
40:29.190 --> 40:32.060
When the time comes, whether it's a reconnaissance plane or a fighter jet,

883
40:29.830 --> 40:33.490
[Chen Fangren, Instructor of 5th Company, 2nd Battalion, 5th Regiment, 2nd Division, 1st Red Army Corps]

884
40:32.630 --> 40:33.780
we'll wipe them out with one shot!

885
40:33.780 --> 40:35.760
Yes, we'll wipe them out with one shot!

886
40:35.760 --> 40:37.190
Wipe them all out.

887
40:37.880 --> 40:38.800
Instructor Chen,

888
40:38.800 --> 40:41.660
you even included our Political Commissar's name.

889
40:44.070 --> 40:45.600
You don't know this, do you?

890
40:46.100 --> 40:48.000
When our Political Commissar changed his name,

891
40:48.000 --> 40:50.150
it was to wipe out all the reactionaries in the world.

892
40:50.150 --> 40:51.020
Comrades,

893
40:52.030 --> 40:53.950
there will definitely be a fierce battle before crossing the river.

894
40:53.950 --> 40:55.750
Everyone, hurry up and prepare.

895
40:56.670 --> 40:57.160
Political Commissar,

896
40:57.160 --> 40:59.020
is what the Instructor said true?

897
40:59.190 --> 40:59.990
That's right.

898
41:02.070 --> 41:04.330
Wipe out the Kuomintang reactionaries!

899
41:04.710 --> 41:06.190
Wipe out the landlords.

900
41:06.760 --> 41:09.220
Wipe out the Japanese devils who invaded us.

901
41:09.800 --> 41:10.590
In short,

902
41:11.480 --> 41:13.740
whoever goes against the common people,

903
41:17.510 --> 41:19.000
we will wipe them out.

904
41:17.970 --> 41:21.890
[Yi Dangping, Political Commissar of the 5th Regiment, 2nd Division, 1st Red Army Corps]

905
41:19.110 --> 41:20.360
Good, well said!

906
41:31.400 --> 41:32.030
Soldier,

907
41:32.330 --> 41:34.220
be careful brushing my boots.

908
41:37.620 --> 41:38.670
Brush along the grain.

909
41:38.670 --> 41:39.310
Yes.

910
41:39.590 --> 41:41.420
Soldier, soldier.

911
41:44.080 --> 41:45.330
Come here.

912
41:45.920 --> 41:47.200
Come to me.

913
41:47.630 --> 41:48.560
Don't be afraid.

914
41:48.840 --> 41:49.590
Come here.

915
41:49.980 --> 41:50.910
Don't be afraid.

916
41:51.430 --> 41:52.360
Come here.

917
41:53.340 --> 41:54.800
I have some coffee for you.

918
41:55.520 --> 41:57.850
Take it. You've never had it before.

919
41:57.880 --> 41:58.720
Try it.

920
42:03.830 --> 42:04.710
Is it good?

921
42:10.520 --> 42:11.290
Bitter.

922
42:15.990 --> 42:17.720
Have you ever had traditional Chinese medicine?

923
42:17.720 --> 42:19.550
It's good for your health.

924
42:19.810 --> 42:21.610
This coffee is also a good thing.

925
42:22.290 --> 42:23.090
Comrade Li De,

926
42:23.250 --> 42:24.360
coffee is a good thing,

927
42:24.360 --> 42:26.360
but the local kids aren't used to it.

928
42:27.480 --> 42:30.010
Then good intentions have led to a bad result.

929
42:30.720 --> 42:31.930
Mao, how is your health?

930
42:31.930 --> 42:32.570
I'm fine.

931
42:32.600 --> 42:33.260
Have a seat.

932
